    questionText: "Based on the information stated above and using an appropriate formula, calculate the value of the multiplier in the Irish economy and explain the economic meaning of your answer. Show all your workings. Write the economic meaning.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"fixed","notation":"4","answer":null,"ofParts":null,"perPart":null}, totalMarks: 4,
    rows: [
    { id: "r-meaning", kind: "point", verbatim: "• In this case if there is an injection of €1 into the circular flow of income, national income will increase by 1.08 times . • Any initial injection of spending will cause a greater increase in the circular flow of income by 1.08 times.", marks: 4, contextNote: "Explain the meaning, 4 marks: an initial €1 injection raises national income by about €1.08 (1.09 with ordinary rounding).", openList: true },
    ],
