    section: "B", questionRef: "2024 HL Q14(a)(i)",
    stem: "In the Irish economy there are many restaurants in the market. This is an example of monopolistic competition.",
    questionText: "Outline three characteristics (other than many sellers) of a firm operating in monopolistic competition.",
