    stem: "The chart below displays Ireland’s general government debt as a percentage of its Modified Gross National Income (GNI*) and of its Gross Domestic Product (GDP) for the years from 2021 to 2025. (Figures for 2024 and 2025 are forecasted).",
    questionText: "Outline the overall trend in Ireland’s general government debt, as shown in the diagram above, using data from the chart. Indicate which overall trend you are commenting on by ticking ( ✓) the relevant box: Government debt as a % of GNI* or Government debt as a % of GDP Answer for: DEBT AS A % OF GNI*.",
