    id: "econ-2025-hl-q13-b-i", topicId: "economics-4-2", conceptId: "the-principle-of-comparative-advantage",
    section: "B", questionRef: "2025 HL Q13(b)(i)",
    stem: "Over 90 foreign pharmaceutical companies operate in Ireland and they employ over 45,000 people.",
    questionText: "Ireland has a comparative advantage in attracting pharmaceutical foreign direct investment (FDI). Explain the principle of comparative advantage.",
