    section: "B", questionRef: "2025 HL Q14(b)(ii) — calculation",
    questionText: "Using an appropriate formula, calculate the price elasticity of demand (PED) for Scentastic, when its price rises from €2.00 to €2.50 and quantity demanded decreases from 30,000 units to 20,000 units. Explain the economic meaning of your answer and show all your workings. Do the calculation.",
