    id: "econ-2026-hl-q12-b-i", topicId: "economics-4-2", conceptId: "tariff",
    section: "B", questionRef: "2026 HL Q12(b)(i)",
    stem: "A trade agreement between the European Union (EU) and the United States (US) came into force in August 2025, which introduced a 15% US tariff on most EU goods.",
    questionText: "Explain what you understand by the economic term tariff.",
